01:40.490 --> 01:41.700
Next!

01:41.700 --> 01:42.490
Yes!

01:45.830 --> 01:47.290
My name is Asami.

01:47.290 --> 01:49.500
I'm a 17-year-old high school girl.

01:49.500 --> 01:52.920
I keep it secret from everyone, but...

01:52.920 --> 01:54.340
I'm actually married.

01:54.840 --> 01:58.340
My husband, Ichimaru Kyousuke-sensei,
teaches at my school.

01:59.430 --> 02:02.260
Good, next! Onohara-san?

02:02.260 --> 02:03.680
Y-Yes!

02:16.440 --> 02:18.530
Those who couldn't land a good spike:

02:18.530 --> 02:22.240
Onohara-san, Horiguchi-san,
and Endou-san...

02:22.620 --> 02:26.040
...will repeat the test
during tomorrow's class.

02:27.540 --> 02:31.380
If you can't do it right tomorrow, I won't pass you.

02:31.380 --> 02:32.670
No way!

02:32.670 --> 02:36.550
If you don't want that,
then practice after school.

02:36.590 --> 02:41.510
Sleeping Together in the Nurse's Office!?

02:49.810 --> 02:53.060
Dang it, I can't take this anymore!

02:53.060 --> 02:55.610
Either way,
we still have to practice.

02:55.610 --> 02:58.320
Katase-sensei sure is strict.

02:58.320 --> 02:59.950
Onohara-san?

03:01.780 --> 03:03.320
Iwasaki-sensei!

03:03.320 --> 03:05.580
Thanks for the help earlier.

03:06.120 --> 03:10.620
Sorry for ruining your
"alone time" with Kouhei.

03:10.620 --> 03:14.380
I-Iwasaki-sensei, Iwasaki-kun and I don't have anything...

03:16.550 --> 03:17.670
...between us.

03:18.010 --> 03:20.260
There's no need to be coy.

03:19.550 --> 03:20.380
What's going on? Dunno.

03:25.010 --> 03:28.600
Are you girls in detention to practice?

03:28.600 --> 03:29.890
Y-Yes.

03:29.890 --> 03:31.730
Shall I lend you a hand?

03:33.690 --> 03:38.230
If you don't get out of detention, you won't be able to go on a date with Kouhei, right?

03:38.230 --> 03:40.280
Like I said!

03:40.280 --> 03:42.610
Come on, don't be shy.

03:47.080 --> 03:48.450
Follow that example.

03:48.450 --> 03:50.910
That was amazing, Iwasaki-sensei.

03:50.910 --> 03:54.630
I may have lost a step, but I was the ace of my high school Volleyball Club.

03:55.500 --> 03:58.130
Shall I demonstrate it again?

03:58.130 --> 03:59.210
First...

03:59.210 --> 04:00.510
Toss!

04:01.920 --> 04:03.800
And then, jump!

04:03.800 --> 04:06.800
Watch this. Put all your strength
into your arm.

04:07.260 --> 04:09.470
Maximum firepower!

04:20.400 --> 04:22.030
Ichimaru-sensei!

04:20.400 --> 04:22.030
Darling!

04:22.030 --> 04:22.740
Eh?

04:22.740 --> 04:24.990
I-I mean...

04:24.990 --> 04:27.070
...did you take d-damage,
Ichimaru-sensei?

04:27.070 --> 04:28.580
Ichimaru-sensei!

04:32.080 --> 04:34.670
Are you all right, Ichimaru-sensei?

04:34.670 --> 04:36.960
I'll take him to the nurse's office, so...

04:36.960 --> 04:39.630
...you girls keep on practicing.

04:41.050 --> 04:42.970
Darling...

04:42.970 --> 04:44.840
Nurse's Office

04:47.140 --> 04:49.850
How're you feeling, Ichimaru-sensei?

04:50.180 --> 04:52.430
Eh? How'd I get here?

04:52.430 --> 04:56.060
I sort of spiked a volleyball
into your face.

04:56.060 --> 04:59.020
Oh, so that's why I passed out.

05:00.190 --> 05:01.820
Ichimaru-sensei...

05:03.690 --> 05:07.620
I-Ichimaru-sensei, I...

05:07.620 --> 05:10.120
W-Where's the school nurse?

05:10.120 --> 05:13.040
There's no one else in here right now, Ichimaru-sensei.

05:13.040 --> 05:15.160
I-Iwasaki-sensei.

05:17.000 --> 05:18.630
Ah, I did it.

05:18.630 --> 05:22.260
Looking good, Satomi. Right, Asami?

05:22.260 --> 05:23.460
Asami?

05:24.920 --> 05:28.090
I'm going to check on Ichimaru-sensei.

05:31.600 --> 05:33.390
U-Umm...

05:33.980 --> 05:35.890
Ichimaru-sensei.

05:35.890 --> 05:38.650
W-What should I do??

05:40.400 --> 05:42.900
Iwasaki-sensei, Iwasaki-sensei...

05:43.190 --> 05:46.030
...please return to
the staff room right away.

05:46.030 --> 05:48.360
Umm, they're calling for you.

05:49.570 --> 05:52.120
How inconvenient.

05:53.330 --> 05:55.370
Please wait here for awhile.

05:58.210 --> 05:59.960
This is so bad.

06:02.590 --> 06:04.090
Asami?

06:04.380 --> 06:06.170
You came to see me.

06:06.170 --> 06:08.470
Are you okay, Darling?

06:08.470 --> 06:10.430
Yeah, I'm fine.

06:14.100 --> 06:15.350
Thank goodness.

06:16.600 --> 06:20.350
I didn't know what I'd do
if you were hurt...

06:20.980 --> 06:22.320
Asami...

06:24.900 --> 06:26.320
Darling...

06:34.290 --> 06:36.330
I-I was worried about Sensei.

06:36.330 --> 06:40.460
Y-Yeah, that's it.
Onohara was worried about me.

06:40.880 --> 06:43.000
I-I'm going back to practice.

06:43.000 --> 06:44.920
Sorry to intrude.

06:46.210 --> 06:48.220
Did I see what I think I saw?

06:49.550 --> 06:53.720
Yet I could swear<i> Onohara-san was going out with Kouhei.</i>

06:55.970 --> 06:58.560
I'm so glad my husband is all right.

07:03.900 --> 07:05.150
Asami!

07:06.690 --> 07:08.900
Nurse's Office

07:13.700 --> 07:16.700
There's something fishy...
about those two.

07:18.120 --> 07:19.330
Onohara!

07:20.080 --> 07:21.620
Onohara, are you all right?

07:21.620 --> 07:23.000
I-Iwasaki-kun?

07:23.000 --> 07:24.290
I heard you collapsed.

07:24.290 --> 07:25.630
I'm fine.

07:25.630 --> 07:28.340
You are? Well, that's good to know.

07:31.050 --> 07:32.680
Kouhei?

07:33.090 --> 07:35.930
Can you walk Onohara-san
back to her house?

07:36.560 --> 07:37.430
What the!?

07:37.430 --> 07:40.680
I'll make sure Ichimaru-sensei makes it home.

07:40.680 --> 07:42.190
Eh!?

07:49.900 --> 07:51.530
Umm, Iwasaki-kun...

07:51.530 --> 07:54.200
...I'll be fine on my own, really.

07:54.200 --> 07:56.160
You don't have to hold back.

07:57.910 --> 07:59.620
Umm, Iwasaki-sensei...

08:00.120 --> 08:02.960
...I'll be fine on my own, really.

08:02.960 --> 08:05.080
Please don't be holding back.

08:13.930 --> 08:15.470
What should I do?

08:30.730 --> 08:32.820
Onohara, do you live alone?

08:33.070 --> 08:35.320
Yeah, kinda.

08:35.320 --> 08:36.700
What now?

08:36.700 --> 08:40.040
If this keeps up,
he might find out I'm married.

08:40.620 --> 08:42.330
S-Say...

08:43.790 --> 08:46.250
Here's fine.

08:47.420 --> 08:49.130
I'll take you all the way home.

08:49.130 --> 08:51.710
Because... I'm worried about you.

08:52.300 --> 08:54.340
I wouldn't want
another "incident"...

08:56.470 --> 08:58.050
Iwasaki-kun...

08:58.050 --> 09:01.020
But I'm all right now. Thank you.

09:01.020 --> 09:02.730
Ah, Onohara!

09:06.350 --> 09:09.360
Ichimaru-sensei,
you live by yourself, right?

09:09.820 --> 09:11.860
Yeah, kind of.

09:12.150 --> 09:16.410
What do I do? If this keeps up, she'll find out about Asami.

09:17.360 --> 09:18.870
U-Umm...

09:20.080 --> 09:22.410
I'll go it alone from here.

09:23.160 --> 09:25.410
Please let me accompany you home!

09:26.750 --> 09:27.880
I wouldn't...

09:28.500 --> 09:31.050
...mind moving forward with you.

09:31.050 --> 09:32.800
Iwasaki-sensei...

09:34.170 --> 09:38.050
Thanks, but I'll be fine. Good night!

09:38.050 --> 09:39.640
Ichimaru-sensei!

09:50.360 --> 09:51.900
What have we here?

09:52.900 --> 09:53.820
Aneki?

09:53.820 --> 09:55.490
Kouhei.

09:55.490 --> 09:56.900
Why are you here?

09:56.900 --> 09:58.700
What about you?

10:07.000 --> 10:08.830
I'm beat.

10:07.000 --> 10:08.830
I'm so tired.

10:11.040 --> 10:13.300
Umm, Darling...

10:14.170 --> 10:17.420
There's nothing between you and Iwasaki-sensei, right?

10:17.420 --> 10:20.550
There's no way there could be anything, right?

10:21.050 --> 10:26.560
But is there something between you and Iwasaki-sensei's little brother, Kouhei-kun?

10:26.980 --> 10:28.770
O-Of course not!

10:33.980 --> 10:35.360
You hungry?

10:35.780 --> 10:37.030
I'll make dinner.

10:37.030 --> 10:38.860
Don't worry about it.

10:38.860 --> 10:41.870
I'm sure we have some instant udon.

10:41.870 --> 10:43.370
Let's have that today.

10:43.370 --> 10:44.990
Eh? But...

10:44.990 --> 10:48.210
It's okay. You've had
a long day, haven't you?

10:49.870 --> 10:51.460
Yes!

10:54.090 --> 10:55.840
Bon appétit!

11:02.600 --> 11:05.720
Meals on the cheap make for a nice change of pace, don't they?

11:05.720 --> 11:07.430
I guess so.

11:07.430 --> 11:11.230
And as long as I'm with you,
anything tastes good.

11:11.230 --> 11:14.060
Aww, Darling.

11:15.440 --> 11:17.070
Darling...

11:17.070 --> 11:21.070
I'm sorry for mistrusting you about Iwasaki-sensei.

11:21.070 --> 11:25.620
As soon as you told me the truth,
I felt at ease.

11:25.620 --> 11:30.000
From now till forever,
please love only me, 'kay?

11:37.760 --> 11:39.420
My name is Asami.

11:39.420 --> 11:41.510
I'm a 17-year-old high school girl.

11:41.970 --> 11:45.550
I keep it secret from everyone, but...

11:45.550 --> 11:47.770
I'm actually married.

11:47.770 --> 11:52.140
My husband, Ichimaru Kyousuke-sensei,
teaches at my school.

12:06.160 --> 12:08.330
Did I wake you?

12:08.330 --> 12:12.750
Huh? Why're you getting up
so early on a Sunday?

12:12.750 --> 12:15.290
The midterm tests start tomorrow, so...

12:15.290 --> 12:18.420
I wanted to get the housework finished and start studying.

12:18.420 --> 12:20.880
Ahh, I see.

12:20.880 --> 12:22.420
The midterm tests, right?

12:23.090 --> 12:25.970
You can feel free to go back to sleep.

12:28.680 --> 12:32.100
Asami is really diligent.

12:34.940 --> 12:37.150
I'd like to help her,

12:37.150 --> 12:40.400
but it's not like I can tell her what'll be on the tests.

12:41.030 --> 12:43.570
If only I could do something<i> for her.</i>

12:46.160 --> 12:47.030
That's it!

12:52.410 --> 12:55.830
Asami, I'll do the chores today.

12:55.830 --> 12:57.290
Eh?

12:57.290 --> 13:01.300
It'll be okay. Leave the house to me.

13:01.710 --> 13:04.840
Asami, you focus on studying for the midterm tests!

13:05.130 --> 13:07.010
Darling...

13:07.010 --> 13:09.180
Thanks a bunch.

13:09.180 --> 13:14.140
My Husband is My Wife?

13:34.830 --> 13:37.000
Umm, Darling...

13:37.000 --> 13:40.040
If you don't stretch out the laundry properly,

13:40.040 --> 13:42.960
it'll get wrinkled when it dries.

13:42.960 --> 13:44.510
Oh?

13:44.510 --> 13:47.340
Is that so? Sorry.

13:57.520 --> 14:00.270
You can be such a klutz, Darling.

14:14.370 --> 14:16.040
Asami?

14:16.330 --> 14:18.040
Umm...

14:19.420 --> 14:23.960
It made a really loud noise,
and now it won't suck up any dirt.

14:24.960 --> 14:26.920
Could it be...

14:27.840 --> 14:29.760
No wonder. It's clogged up.

14:30.180 --> 14:34.810
Darling, the vacuum can't suck up
large pieces of garbage.

14:34.810 --> 14:37.520
Eh? Is that so?

14:38.230 --> 14:39.770
Sorry, Asami.

14:39.770 --> 14:42.650
I... interrupted your studies again, didn't I?

14:43.070 --> 14:44.820
N-Not at all.

15:01.380 --> 15:03.790
B-Broom, where's the broom...

15:05.340 --> 15:09.090
The broom and... where's the dustpan?

15:13.100 --> 15:16.100
Umm... Darling?

15:16.100 --> 15:17.560
What is it?

15:17.560 --> 15:19.020
Umm...

15:19.020 --> 15:20.730
Err...

15:21.560 --> 15:22.900
What's the matter?

15:22.900 --> 15:25.520
No, nothing at all.

15:38.410 --> 15:41.670
My husband is doing the housework, but...

15:41.670 --> 15:44.290
...I just can't concentrate on studying.

15:44.790 --> 15:47.000
Asami-oneechan!

15:48.380 --> 15:50.380
Let's play together!

15:50.380 --> 15:52.260
Sasuke-kun.

15:52.760 --> 15:54.180
I'm busy today.

15:54.180 --> 15:58.560
Hey now, Asami's midterm tests
start tomorrow.

15:58.560 --> 16:00.230
She has to study.

16:00.640 --> 16:03.730
Huh? What's with that outfit, Sensei?

16:03.730 --> 16:07.980
I'm doing the the chores
that Asami normally does.

16:07.980 --> 16:10.650
That way, she can
concentrate on her studies.

16:12.610 --> 16:15.070
Then I'll help too!

16:15.660 --> 16:17.080
You will, Sasuke-kun?

16:17.080 --> 16:21.500
If it's for Asami-oneechan's sake,
then you can count on me.

16:33.470 --> 16:35.220
Hey there, Sasuke-kun.

16:35.220 --> 16:36.470
Yay!

16:36.470 --> 16:39.430
Hey, don't run through
the house all soaking wet!

16:40.270 --> 16:42.230
I said stop!

16:49.070 --> 16:51.280
Asami-oneechan's scent...

16:51.740 --> 16:53.700
What're you <i>doing,</i> Sasuke-kun?

16:54.200 --> 16:57.740
I need to air out the futon, so let go.

16:57.740 --> 17:01.450
I need a little longer hit of Asami-oneechan's scent...

17:01.450 --> 17:03.540
Hell yeah, that's the good stuff!

17:14.470 --> 17:17.300
Now you've done it! Take that!

17:18.760 --> 17:20.060
Sasuke-kun!

17:23.230 --> 17:25.310
Take that! And that!

17:26.060 --> 17:26.980
You like that?!

17:26.980 --> 17:29.360
Ahh! Oh no!

17:29.360 --> 17:31.480
I have you now!

17:31.480 --> 17:33.440
Lemme go, lemme go!

17:36.660 --> 17:38.570
A-Asami...

17:38.570 --> 17:39.870
Onee-chan...

17:39.870 --> 17:44.040
Geez, you two are so hyperactive.

17:49.500 --> 17:51.590
Now I have to wash this again.

17:56.510 --> 17:58.390
Sorry, Asami.

17:58.390 --> 17:59.760
I'm sorry too.

17:59.760 --> 18:01.850
I-It's okay.

18:11.110 --> 18:13.860
I-I'm going home.

18:30.130 --> 18:32.670
I'm sorry about all this, Asami.

18:33.630 --> 18:36.630
I thought I was helping you...

18:37.340 --> 18:39.680
...not hindering you, like this.

18:40.260 --> 18:43.640
Is there nothing left for me to do?

18:45.970 --> 18:50.150
Ah! I've still got one card up my sleeve!

18:54.860 --> 18:57.400
"Kamoshita Bookstore"

18:55.610 --> 18:57.400
P-Please wait!

19:00.660 --> 19:02.120
Let's see...

19:03.490 --> 19:06.200
Excellent. This'll do the trick.

19:18.380 --> 19:20.510
That's one less to worry about.

19:22.930 --> 19:25.430
I'll take a little nap...

19:27.100 --> 19:29.810
...and when I wake up,
I can make breakfast,

19:30.520 --> 19:32.810
wake my husband up, and...

19:56.750 --> 19:59.510
Did he put this on me?

20:01.760 --> 20:03.430
Let's see...

20:01.760 --> 20:06.350
"Basic Cookbook"

20:03.430 --> 20:06.350
...once the soup stock is in
and starts to steam,

20:06.350 --> 20:10.770
extinguish the flame.
Then the miso? Miso, miso...

20:11.850 --> 20:14.690
Where <i>is</i> that miso...

20:14.690 --> 20:15.940
Here.

20:15.940 --> 20:18.020
Ah, thanks!

20:19.230 --> 20:21.110
Asami?!

20:21.490 --> 20:23.990
D-Did I wake you?

20:23.990 --> 20:25.240
Not at all.

20:25.240 --> 20:27.080
Wait a while, okay?

20:27.080 --> 20:29.120
It's almost done.

20:31.290 --> 20:34.460
This much miso should do it.

20:36.670 --> 20:38.920
Sorry about yesterday.

20:39.630 --> 20:42.090
I was worse than useless.

20:43.340 --> 20:44.890
Darling...

20:46.430 --> 20:48.430
It's fine.

20:56.560 --> 20:58.900
Guess I forgot to make
any side dishes.

21:04.450 --> 21:07.120
It's a tad on the crunchy side.

21:09.740 --> 21:11.830
You just have to
chew it thoroughly.

21:12.700 --> 21:14.750
As for the miso soup...

21:15.790 --> 21:18.540
It's kinda spicy, isn't it?

21:18.880 --> 21:21.590
No, it's just fine.

21:22.590 --> 21:23.970
Really?

21:23.970 --> 21:27.550
Yes, this level of spiciness is
a real eye-opener.

21:27.550 --> 21:29.510
I-Is that so?

21:30.140 --> 21:36.900
"Ichimaru"

21:38.770 --> 21:40.690
I'm overjoyed.

21:40.690 --> 21:44.610
The rice was a little dry,
and the miso soup was rather spicy, but...

21:45.070 --> 21:48.450
...he did the best he could for my sake.

21:48.450 --> 21:50.580
That's enough to make me happy.

21:51.410 --> 21:54.790
I'm sure you'll improve in time, Darling!

22:15.390 --> 22:18.900
All I am is a kitten

22:15.390 --> 22:18.900
watashi wa koneko

22:18.900 --> 22:22.820
All for you, and yours alone

22:18.900 --> 22:22.820
anata hitori dake no

22:22.820 --> 22:29.700
A naive little kitten; I want you to raise me right.

22:22.820 --> 22:29.700
mijuku na koneko sodatete hoshii no

22:30.240 --> 22:33.740
Can't you grant me this simple wish for anything

22:30.240 --> 22:33.740
nozomareru koto no subete ni

22:33.740 --> 22:37.910
and every last thing that I desire?

22:33.740 --> 22:37.910
kotaete yukeru kana

22:37.910 --> 22:41.330
If you stare at me with those longing, hungry eyes,

22:37.910 --> 22:41.330
nagai me de mitete kuretara

22:41.330 --> 22:47.260
I'll make this scene hotter and hotter just for you

22:41.330 --> 22:47.260
dokidoki sasete itte ageru

22:47.260 --> 22:54.640
Your kisses are like love vitamins,
so give me more and more of them.

22:47.260 --> 22:54.640
ai no bitamin kiss motto choudai

22:54.640 --> 23:01.560
Wrapped inside your loving arms so tight,
I can sleep again tonight.

22:54.640 --> 23:01.560
itoshii ude no naka kyou mo nemuru no

23:02.190 --> 23:11.700
Forever and ever only yours; just a kitten of love.

23:02.190 --> 23:11.700
zutto anata dake no ai no koneko

23:28.590 --> 23:44.480
Preview

23:29.380 --> 23:30.760
Asami here.

23:30.760 --> 23:35.430
This is great! I get to go stargazing alone with my husband!

23:35.430 --> 23:38.310
I'll bring some boxed meals, okay?

23:38.310 --> 23:42.310
So please, love me lots next week too.
